\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Stk Indexes Decline After 12 Straight Gains; Sol Unch   \b0\par\par\uc2 324 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 April 2007\par 22:38\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes fell Wednesday after gaining for 12 consecutive sessions, as profit-taking and weaker mineral prices stopped the rising trend.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results from the Lima Stock Exchange, the stock market's broad general index fell 97.29 points, or 0.51%, to end at 18,848.86.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index decreased 185.30 points, or 0.58%, to finish at 31,907.64.   \par \par \uc2 "What we are seeing is some profit-taking, a correction following what we were also seeing in other markets," one market analyst said.   \par \par \uc2 Copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA, (CVERDEC1.VL), which this year through Tuesday had risen some 65%, on Wednesday declined 2.8% to end at $23.34, as copper prices eased.   \par \par \uc2 Heavily-traded zinc miner  \uc2 Volcan Compania Minera\uc2  SAA (VOLB.VL) dropped 0.3% to end at 10.65 soles ($3.35).   \par \par \uc2 It had increased some 32.7% this year through Tuesday, according to Banco de Credito.   \par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner  \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN) lost 1.0% to end at PEN98.00 on weaker gold prices.   \par \par \uc2 Blue chip financial holding company  \uc2 Credicorp Ltd.\uc2  (BAP) also gave up some recent gains, ending 0.7% lower at $51.16.   \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol Wednesday ended unchanged at a midrate of PEN3.1815 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.1810 to PEN3.1820.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $45 million.   \par \par \uc2 A market analyst said that there was demand for the sol in order to pay corporate income taxes.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in recent sessions to buy dollars to ease movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires;peru@dowjones.com; 51-1-221 7050 [ 04-11-07 1638ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020070411e34b00084\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
