\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Stock Indexes End With Gains; Sol Appreciates  \b0\par\par\uc2 271 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Februar 2007\par 22:42\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended higher again Thursday, as miner Compania de Minas Buenaventura SAA and other blue chip companies gained ground.  \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results from the Lima Stock Exchange, the stock market's broad general index rose 105.54 points, or 0.76%, to end at 13,965.82.  \par \par \uc2 The selective blue chip index increased 79.48 points, or 0.34%, to finish at 23,394.75.  \par \par \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura SAA (BVN) gained 1.2% to end at 85.00 soles ($26.64) as gold prices increased.  \par \par \uc2 Banco Continental (CONTINC1) rose 1.6% to end at PEN7.62.  \par \par \uc2 Energy producer Edegel SAA (EDEGELC1.VL) gained 8.0% to end at PEN1.75 in heavy trade.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $10 million.  \par \par \uc2 The sol ended slightly stronger at a midrate of PEN3.1895 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.1890 to PEN3.1900.  \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.1910 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.1900 to PEN3.1920.  \par \par \uc2 The sol has been gaining strength recently in part due to the sale of U.S. dollars by companies seeking soles before the start of the Feb. 9 tax payment period.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year to ease movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.  \par \par \uc2 -Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires;peru@dowjones.com; 51-1-221 7050 [ 02-08-07 1642ET ]  \par \par \uc2 1071 1837  \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020070208e32800073\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
