w York-traded American Depositary Receipt.  \par \par \uc2 -Robert Kozak; Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires  \par \par \uc2 01-11-06 1546ET  \par \par \uc2 Dokument OSTDJ00020060111e21b00310\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
