\par\par \b \uc2 Peru Stock Indexes Sharply Lower; Sol Weakens Again  \b0\par\par\uc2 323 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Dezember 2005\par 21:38\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's stock market ended sharply weaker Thursday as a wide range of blue chip shares fell on weaker metals prices and on jitters before next April's elections.  \par \par \uc2 The stock market's broad general index lost 167.84 points, or 3.25%, to end at 4993.17, while the selective blue chip index fell 267.64 points, or 3.23%, to close at 8018.42.  \par \par \uc2 Bear Stearns on Thursday cut Peruvian equities to underweight from market weight, citing recent strong returns in equity prices and the view that political risk before the upcoming elections isn't fully reflected in asset prices.  \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLB.VL) lost 4.9% to end at 1.17 soles ($0.34) as zinc prices fell.  \par \par \uc2 Zinc-lead miner Compania Minera Atacocha SA (ATACOC1.VL) lost 4.1% to end at PEN2.83 as workers threatened to strike next week.  \par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner Compania de Minas Buenaventura SAA (BVN) lost 4.9% to end at PEN99.90 on weaker gold prices.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sol weakened again Thursday, despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which sold $43 million.  \par \par \uc2 The sol ended at a midrate of PEN3.4395 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.4390-PEN3.4400.  \par \par \uc2 The sol closed the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.4370 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.4360-PEN3.4380.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also placed PEN102.6 million in adjustable certificates of deposits, considered an equivalent to selling dollars.  \par \par \uc2 The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been weakening on increased buying of dollars by private pension funds, higher U.S. interest rates and on nervousness over the upcoming elections.  \par \par \uc2 The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 3.39% on Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 -Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 12-15-05 1538ET ]  \par \par \uc2 1071 1837  \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020051215e1cf0003q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
