\par\par \b \uc2 Peru Stock Market Falls; Sol Weakens Again  \b0\par\par\uc2 228 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Oktober 2005\par 23:02\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--The Lima stock indexes ended lower Thursday, led by declines in some key mining shares.  \par \par \uc2 The stock market's broad general index fell 65.91 points, or 1.30%, to end at 4990.98, while the selective blue chip index lost 122.27 points, or 1.52%, to close at 7931.24.  \par \par \uc2 Southern Peru Copper Corp. (PCU) fell 2.5% to end at $51.80, on declining copper prices.  \par \par \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura SAA (BVN) declined 2.4% to end at PEN103.25 ($30.40) as gold prices weakened.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sol ended slightly weaker Thursday, despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which sold $11.5 million.  \par \par \uc2 Peru's sol ended at a midrate of PEN3.3965 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.3960-PEN3.3970.  \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.3910 on a spread of PEN3.3890-PEN3.3930, despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which sold $22 million.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's selling of U.S. dollars was the first since September 2002, and came after the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened sharply.  \par \par \uc2 The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 2.96% on Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 -Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-13-05 1702ET ]  \par \par \uc2 1071 1837  \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020051013e1ad00093\par }\par \b \uc2 Z